- User requested progress reports only after successful smoke/e2e during completion phase; subsequent UI work included concise updates.
- macOS testing deferred by user. Current support and manifest remain **Linux-only**.
- Apply `/home/user/.agents/skills/write-discoverable-code/SKILL.md` when writing/naming code.

